Z||000004||Cliff Pennock||10-10-2001||07:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Loki:<BR><B>BTW Cliff, is there a way to make it where I could STAY logged in on PFF on this machine? So I dont have to keep on with the ID and PW everytime I come to this page?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It should do that already. It might be that your cookies are a bit messed up. Click <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/ubbmisc.cgi?action=clearcookies" TARGET=_blank>here</A> to clear this forum's cookies. Restart your browser (the first time it will have forgotten which threads you have read and which you haven't), reply to a message, restart your browser again and hopefully it will have remembered your username and password.||||reg||1
